{"id":262060,"shortDescription":"Darkest Dungeon es un desafiante juego de rol gótico en mazmorras y por turnos que gira en torno al esfuerzo psicológico de la aventura. Recluta, entrena y lidera a un equipo de héroes imperfectos a través de enrevesados bosques, laberintos olvidados, criptas en ruinas y más allá.","developers":["Red Hook Studios"],"publishers":["Red Hook Studios"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Cromos de Steam","Compatible con DualShock","Compat. parcial con mando","Steam Cloud","Remote Play en tableta","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"19 ENE 2016","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/262060/d0af01c9e1cc94da81eb71c21627ef9303f2f038/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1789168187","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/262060/ss_04572edc979601b038756f87861c6f8c6c337806.600x338.jpg?t=1789168187","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/262060/ss_04572edc979601b038756f87861c6f8c6c337806.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789168187"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/262060/ss_799c78932c87f2be0cbd45dd1b80ebd0a355e575.600x338.jpg?t=1789168187","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/262060/ss_799c78932c87f2be0cbd45dd1b80ebd0a355e575.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789168187"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/262060/ss_a967c2d7344433cdf72a53ef1922586b0d7cce69.600x338.jpg?t=1789168187","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/262060/ss_a967c2d7344433cdf72a53ef1922586b0d7cce69.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789168187"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/262060/ss_c9d41e74d574f6fa9bf53c0cf74f8430c2072cc2.600x338.jpg?t=1789168187","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/262060/ss_c9d41e74d574f6fa9bf53c0cf74f8430c2072cc2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1789168187